extends layout

block content
  h1 University Portal
  h2 Welcome!

  p Enter your ID and select your role to continue.

  form(action="/" method="get")
    label(for="ID") Enter your ID:
    input(type="text" name="ID" id="ID")

    p Select your role:

    label
      input(type="radio" name="role" value="Student" required)
      | Student

    label
      input(type="radio" name="role" value="Faculty")
      | Faculty

    label
      input(type="radio" name="role" value="Registrar")
      | Registrar

    br
    br
    button(type="submit") Continue